              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Kabine — \"the cabin; the changing cubicle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Unsere Kabine hat ein kleines rundes Fenster. Our cabin has a small round window."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Kabinen. In a clothes shop, die Kabine is the changing cubicle."
            }
          ]
        },
